# Final Showdown's first mode ({W} + {1}): "All creatures lose all abilities until end of turn." Bot1 and Bot2 each have an
# Ornithopter (flying) on turn 3. After the mode resolves neither has flying (both players' creatures, CR 613.1f), but a second
# Ornithopter Bot1 casts afterwards is not in the set the effect affects (CR 611.2c) and keeps its flying. At Bot2's next turn (the
# until-end-of-turn effect has ended, CR 514.2) Bot2's Ornithopter flies again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Final Showdown
Ornithopter
Plains x3
Ornithopter
Plains x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Hand.Final Showdown.Cast
Bot1.Modes(1)
